  "contracts": [
    "Expected checked declaration/body/signature/call and nonsuspending summary identities are retained. Actual callee remains tagged SSA; checked source proof does not authenticate runtime FunctionInfo.",
    "Every evaluated argument remains a use even when result is discarded. The one result is edge-defined by the dedicated continuation first parameter; unreachable incoming edges also reject forged continuations.",
    "Pruning records original result offset before changing unused-result mode to discard and preserves live-through operands.",
    "Native graphs refuse invoke. Frozen v5, graph.lower and core program.fromBlocks reject before derivation or output mutation."
  ],
